# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT FILES TO KEEP IN GITHUB
# ============================================================

# The following should NOT be ignored:
#
# frontend/package.json
# frontend/package-lock.json
# backend/requirements.txt
# backend/app/
# backend/init_db.py
# .env.example
# frontend/.env.example
# backend/.env.example
# .streamlit/config.toml
#
# Keep your actual application source code and configuration
# templates in GitHub.